 "offset_seconds": 2.5199999999996905,
 "words_heard": 274,
 "words": 276,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A great eagle with wings so wide",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Came down to Lebanon's pride",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Took the top of the cedar tree",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Carried it to a foreign see",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Planted it in merchant soil",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Beside the water, low and toil",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "It grew a vine with branches spread",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Its roots reached out as it fed",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But another eagle stood nearby",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With thick and heavy plumage dry",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The vine bent its roots toward him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seeking water in his rim",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It had good soil and rain",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To bear fruit without vain strain",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But it turned to a second king",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And broke the sacred, holy thing",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will take a sprig from the top",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the lofty cedar's crop",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And plant it on a high mountain",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where the birds in shade are wanting",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It will become a majestic tree",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where all the birds shall be",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The king of Babylon came strong",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Took the crown and led it along",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Made a covenant with the prince",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Swore an oath for the defense",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he rebelled and sent envoys",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To Egypt for horses and toys",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He broke the oath and despised the vow",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In Babylon he shall now bow",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will take a sprig from the top",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the lofty cedar's crop",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And plant it on a high mountain",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where the birds in shade are wanting",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It will become a majestic tree",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where all the birds shall be",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I bring down the high and lift the low",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I make the dry and dead tree grow",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All the trees of the field will know",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That I, the Lord, am the power",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I, the Lord, have spoken and will do",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
